        {
          "id": "d06-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q4 2025 the plan assumes a return to hiring in engineering and customer success. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $10.9M for Q4 2025, weighted towards warehouse automation.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 97.4
